issue.description:
**PRD:** https://rnd.frontiir.net/en/products/rt/requirements/noc-ticket-automation-prd

Technical items left open in the Dev draft #22265 section 4.3 (plain-text reference).

**Items:**

- RT Web UI request schema;
- API route on the RT External API;
- Kafka topic name;
- message key and partition strategy;
- exact RT custom-field values to write (Ticket Problem, Root Cause, Service Root Cause, SAI, RCC, Resolution Description), to be confirmed with the NOC Manager.

Retry backoff, schedule and worker configuration are out of scope (retry worker deferred to a follow-up release).

**Affects:** Story S9 (#22957) and S2 (#22950).

**Done when:** each item is decided by Dev and recorded on this Task and on the affected Story.
